:"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-24T18:37:18Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T07:36:50Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6 latest\n\n### System information\n\nmacos\n\n### Issue description\n\nUsing a GDScript method name in a boolean context is almost always due to the programmer forgetting to add parentheses.  In a language with property getters, it is easy to forget which boolean-sounding names are getters and which are method calls, leading to silent failures.  I personally keep running into this with `Node.is_node_ready`, which I keep trying to use as a getter.\n\nExample:\n\n```gdscript\n@onready var my_int: int = 4\nvar my_int_getter: int:\n\tget:\n\t\tif not is_node_ready: # method name implicitly converted to false\n\t\t\tawait ready # never runs\n\t\treturn my_int\n\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\n\tprint(await self.my_int_getter) # prints 0\n```\n\nThis should emit a warning (if not an error), but instead silently casts to false.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee example code above.\nExpected output: 4\nActual output: 0\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117804/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117804/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}